    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GRID TWEAKER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Grid. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GRID TWEAKER</strong> is an incremental deck-building game set in a corporate run prison. Construct an economy from the confines of your cell, fine tune your <strong>Crushers</strong>, and push the system to its limits. Whether you thrive through <strong>optimization</strong> or <strong>exploitation</strong>, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686260/extras/807ce771b5e7933750488ff46f2b1ce3.poster.avif?t=1747262403\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686260/extras/807ce771b5e7933750488ff46f2b1ce3.webm?t=1747262403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686260/extras/807ce771b5e7933750488ff46f2b1ce3.mp4?t=1747262403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE GRID\u2122 </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>cell  interface</strong> is more than just a screen\u2014it\u2019s your only shot at survival. <strong>Place, upgrade, and arrange Crushers</strong> to generate profit with ruthless efficiency. Every second of productivity matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686260/extras/66a1b6c612712eeb68dcb766020a0d3d.poster.avif?t=1747262403\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686260/extras/66a1b6c612712eeb68dcb766020a0d3d.webm?t=1747262403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686260/extras/66a1b6c612712eeb68dcb766020a0d3d.mp4?t=1747262403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMPLIANCE &amp; CAPITALIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bribe <strong>inmates, guards, and even demons\u00a0</strong>to unlock exclusive privileges and expand your empire. The more you invest, the more control you seize. The more you control, the less likely you are to vanish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686260/extras/b879a399d6e128550a5ecaf377f9e8a8.poster.avif?t=1747262403\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686260/extras/b879a399d6e128550a5ecaf377f9e8a8.webm?t=1747262403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686260/extras/b879a399d6e128550a5ecaf377f9e8a8.mp4?t=1747262403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVAL OF THE RUTHLESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>Crushers</strong> aren\u2019t the only thing being tested. Rival inmates will <strong>scheme, sabotage, and steal</strong> from you if given the chance. <strong>Train, gamble, or carve better dice</strong> to ensure that when the dust settles, <strong>you\u2019re the one left standing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686260/extras/ed225b120aea0214a25c54e0345ab97a.poster.avif?t=1747262403\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686260/extras/ed225b120aea0214a25c54e0345ab97a.webm?t=1747262403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686260/extras/ed225b120aea0214a25c54e0345ab97a.mp4?t=1747262403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A STRATEGIC INCREMENTAL EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GRID TWEAKER</strong> fuses <strong>incremental mechanics, deck-building strategy, and survival\u00a0 resource management\u00a0</strong>into a relentless game of risk and reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>debt is real.</strong> Your <strong>freedom is a lie.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing that matters is <strong>profit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work. Tweak. Dominate. Welcome to the Grid.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686260/extras/c7d895d6ce52e184b46fc577b07e9221.poster.avif?t=1747262403\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686260/extras/c7d895d6ce52e184b46fc577b07e9221.webm?t=1747262403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686260/extras/c7d895d6ce52e184b46fc577b07e9221.mp4?t=1747262403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
